          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"writing-skill-lora-rewriter-training\">Writing-skill LoRA rewriter \u2014 training</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook fine-tunes Qwen3-14B with LoRA so that the model\nrewrites a raw draft into the writing skill's style while\npreserving every fact, number, unit, symbol and citation.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Steps, in order:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>Select a GPU machine type (RTX PRO 6000) before running.</li>\n<li>Check the environment cell; install missing packages if the\n   installer button appears.</li>\n<li>Confirm the dataset and model settings, then load the dataset.</li>\n<li>Load the model, then train. Checkpoints are saved per epoch,\n   so a closed session resumes from the last epoch.</li>\n<li>Optionally run the small evaluation, then upload the adapter\n   (private by default) with a Hugging Face write token.</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
